  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 对话沙盒研学创始人，把热爱做成副业，有多酷！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682af583fcbc2e206ba8ec52</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682af583fcbc2e206ba8ec52</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 May 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>专业设计师遇上博物馆研学，会碰撞出怎样的火花？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期《小宁的创业圈》，</span></p><span></span><p><span>邀请到了身兼设计师与博物馆研学讲师双重身份的【沙包老师】，</span></p><span></span><p><span>听他聊聊是如何在繁忙的工作之余，</span></p><span></span><p><span>将对文博的热爱发展成一份有声有色、为爱发电的副业！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也对博物馆、历史文化充满好奇，或者也想把自己的热爱变成一份事业，那这期节目你绝对不能错过！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Time Line】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">00:01:15</a> 沙包老师的“双重身份”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">00:02:31</a> 热爱博物馆的种子何时埋下？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">00:03:42</a> 从幕后到台前，创立“沙河研学”的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">00:05:11</a> 北京博物馆资源有多丰富？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">00:07:50</a> 本地VS外地？沙包老师的学生从哪里来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">00:09:27</a> 真诚是最好的“圈粉”利器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">00:13:18</a> &nbsp;热爱可抵岁月漫长：如何平衡主副业？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1118">00:18:38</a> &nbsp;想把热爱做成副业？沙包老师的建议来啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1557">00:25:57</a> &nbsp;如何让孩子逛博物馆过目不忘？揭秘博物馆的正确打开方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">00:32:15</a> &nbsp;研学老师怎么获取知识？沙包老师的私藏推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2132">00:35:32</a> &nbsp;AI技术对博物馆行业的升级</span></p><span></span><p><span>【特别环节】认识宝藏沙包老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>沙包老师不仅对文博知识如数家珍，更是一位乐于分享、真诚待人的朋友。如果大家对博物馆研学感兴趣，或者想咨询北京有哪些值得一看的展览，都可以添加他的微信进行交流。他会非常乐意和大家沟通博物馆的正确打开方式和最新的展览信息哦！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnoIjWVp2wJJ-TP0q8CLI-Atmprx.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67a1ff01e09c8525a694dd50/llgncQZ86UcsU3locS_oa4D4-PPx.m4a" length="54387888" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlztcVVlZd3VwH_o8DJ4FpZxVwZ5.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.9 没钱拍电影？活用AI工具，砍掉80%制作成本</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680dd91a7a449ae858f2778c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680dd91a7a449ae858f2778c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 May 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“别等完美，先用AI跑通流程！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有演员，没有团队，低成本也能做短剧？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：资深导演张导，从传统影视转型AI开发的先行者，操刀多部网大、短剧，现专注AI影视商业化。带你解锁AI影视红利期的财富密码！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目在超元线下活动录制，感兴趣的朋友可以联系我，来现场和嘉宾互动呀</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhfFxpQvc4psaAN_LcqMlCXRcHN-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【Time Line】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">00:02:49</a> &nbsp;用DeepSeek、ChatGPT快速生成剧本框架，解决灵感枯竭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">00:07:04</a> 推荐选题：封神、狄仁杰等经典IP，自带观众基础，降低市场风险。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="538">00:08:58</a> 用AI生成“姜子牙”“土行孙”等角色初稿，节省建模成本。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">00:09:29</a> 优先选择3D卡通风格，规避真人AI的违和感。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">00:10:28</a> Runway一键抠像+AE合成背景，复杂场景，效率提升90%。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67a1ff01e09c8525a694dd50/lvcCBL77OuvLTcKUV60-p-UVYd-Z.m4a" length="11739233" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:12:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtTVw6S6dtQEKgGau8SlIJJ4gxcQ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.8 剧组停工时，我们靠什么养活梦想？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ed00470decaeb09479c318</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ed00470decaeb09479c318</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>当影视人没戏拍的时候，他们都在做些什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，小宁er继续开始新尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span>在</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b067c9811be1022c4dc27e7?xsec_token=YBn3rVvSihrK4lIb6mKDAj2_EYwgHC1iEEysz1bpRPxzU%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5aa25294e8ac2b7c8a675095&amp;apptime=1743585241&amp;share_id=530fe5d1a580442ba5296732169f8c9b&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b067c9811be1022c4dc27e7?xsec_token=YBn3rVvSihrK4lIb6mKDAj2_EYwgHC1iEEysz1bpRPxzU%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5aa25294e8ac2b7c8a675095&amp;apptime=1743585241&amp;share_id=530fe5d1a580442ba5296732169f8c9b&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>演员小张</span></a><span>（点击跳转直播间账号）的直播间聊聊影视人的“待机模式”</span></p><span></span><p><span>不拍戏的日子里，影视人要怎么维持状态？</span></p><span></span><p><span>从被剧组选择到主动孵化项目，需要跨过哪些坎？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也好奇影视人离开片场后的真实日常，</span></p><span></span><p><span>或者正在寻找平衡理想与现实的方法，</span></p><span></span><p><span>接下来的时间，或许能给你打开新思路......</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下人群必听：</span></p><span></span><p><span>✅ 影视民工：找副业灵感 + 防坑指南</span></p><span></span><p><span>✅ 斜杠青年：解锁“不务正业”的正确姿势</span></p><span></span><p><span>✅ 学生党：围观真实的影视圈生存实录</span></p><span></span><p><span>✅ 所有在搞钱和搞理想之间反复横跳的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Time Line】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">00:01:02</a> 剧组里，人人都是斜杠青年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="367">00:06:07</a> 没戏拍的时候，剧组里的各个工种都在做些什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">00:06:21</a> 导演组在做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">00:06:57</a> 摄影组在做什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">00:07:41</a> 灯光组在做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">00:09:09</a> 服化组在做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">00:11:12</a> 美术组在做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">00:12:32</a> 花絮组在做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">00:13:30</a> 演员们在做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">00:15:54</a> 没活儿干的时候，影视人要如何对抗焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">00:18:32</a> 从“等通告”到“造项目”，为什么演员也要孵化剧本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">00:22:11</a> 影视人的跨界工作，如何在其他行业也闪闪发光</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67a1ff01e09c8525a694dd50/llHuNPrmIgH7BwuRzm4-NYG-rVD7.m4a" length="34152573" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:23:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmIHcFKq8ddgd97ckspkW8U_TTUM.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.7 音乐原来是门好生意？精准授权撬动市场的商业蓝海</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67df69a6dd11f9c8c1721383</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67df69a6dd11f9c8c1721383</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>从业20年的资深音乐人，手把手教你用音乐版权打开欧美市场！</span></p><span></span><p><span>过去十年流媒体收入暴涨110%，</span></p><span></span><p><span>2023年全球音乐市场收入达286亿美元，</span></p><span></span><p><span>但90%的音乐人还在靠演出“吃饭”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目在“”超元线下活动“现场录制，邀请到的是音乐人李阳老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>他将用真实案例，讲述音乐出海的真实变现逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>Spotify播放分成规则到AI智能分发工具，</span></p><span></span><p><span>从影视授权谈判技巧到避开版权“霸王条款”，这期全是硬核干货！</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论你是音乐人、创业者，还是对文娱投资感兴趣，</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期内容一定能点亮你的灵感！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>注意：李阳老师最近在寻找优秀的音乐新人，热爱音乐的朋友可以留言联系呀</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【Time Line】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">00:01:28</a> 为什么说“音乐”的性价比是最高的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">00:03:30</a> 传统的音乐发行流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">00:04:54</a> 自媒体音乐人=唱片公司缩水？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">00:05:56</a> 以个人音乐人身份入驻平台，势单力薄？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">00:06:17</a> 音乐海外平台怎么发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">00:07:10</a> 海外音乐平台有哪些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">00:10:42</a> Spotify ——音乐人发歌的最终阵地（小宁的创业圈也有在Spotify</span></p><span></span><p><span>上线哦）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="777">00:12:57</a> 海外发歌与国内发歌的区别</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67a1ff01e09c8525a694dd50/lpP8lkAYRFDCrFeKgUwn0-Nn0eLG.m4a" length="13150131" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:13:33</itunes:duration>
