    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d91ff178103db3bd2dc4e9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025年，金税四期全面上线</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对金税四期改革，</span></p><span></span><p><span>创业者如何从“被动应对”转向“主动合规”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目邀请【众观科技】的财税专家“于老师”为我们分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论你是正在创业，还是企业已初具规模，</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期内容都可能帮你省下‘百万级’的潜在成本。</span></p><span></span><p><span>准备好笔记，我们马上开始！（注：本节目为精简版本，完整版在“超元”线下活动中哦）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Time Line】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">00:01:35</a> 从金税三期到金税四期，“系统升级”“加强监管”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">00:02:34</a> 影视传媒行业的相关“税”事， 你知道多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">00:03:53</a> 什么是“数电票”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">00:05:44</a> “工作室”要慎开？原因究竟是......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">00:07:27</a> 金税四期的强大之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">00:08:02</a> 合理合法合规，一定要记牢</span></p><span></span><p><span>【众观科技】</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别感谢“众观科技”对本期节目的大力支持</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjTklWbTASvqcHUV8bSkJHiSg1mS.png"></figure>]]></description>
