  <item>
    <title>Vol.5 deepseek只是开始？AI交互性革命即将到来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d59837e924d4525ad8ff13</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d59837e924d4525ad8ff13</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>当所有人还在为deepseek的进化速度惊叹时，</span></p><span></span><p><span>一场更底层的交互革命已悄然逼近</span></p><span></span><p><span>AI将如何重新定义人类与技术的对话方式？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目在“超元创变者线下活动”同步录制</span></p><span></span><p><span>没能来到现场的朋友也可以收听到啦（悄咪咪说一句，线下活动惊喜更多哦）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目邀请到AI领域专家，谱墨智能的罗总</span></p><span></span><p><span>为我们前瞻AI领域的发展趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span>从「被动问答」到「主动共创」</span></p><span></span><p><span>从「文字交互」到「全感官协同」</span></p><span></span><p><span>创业者该如何抢占下一波万亿级入口？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Time Line】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">00:01:46</a> Deepseek 和Manus 的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">00:03:46</a> 还不够完美？deepseek的缺陷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">00:05:46</a> 不止是AI，更是「超级员工」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">00:07:50</a> 人工智能有意识吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">00:08:56</a> AI视频将迎来重大变革</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">00:09:30</a> AI的商业化变现，不再是“卖课割韭菜”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">00:12:07</a> AI只是工具，专业的事还是要专业的人去做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="869">00:14:29</a> AI究竟会不会取代人类？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">00:15:16</a> 当AI成为你的「外挂大脑」，个体生产力将如何指数级爆发？</span></p>]]></description>
