    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b9568b05a90dfd0d1445c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Feb 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期立flag的节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期节目中，我会介绍我录制播客的初心</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及在空闲时间过于碎片化的情况下</span></p><span></span><p><span>deepseek帮我制定的时间规划方案</span></p><span></span><p><span>下一步就是要实践啦，一定要坚持呀</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望我的经验可以给大家带来一些时间规划灵感</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家要是有好用的碎片时间利用法，也欢迎在评论区留言讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Time Line】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:00:29</a> 当时间变得碎片化，我开始重新规划我的时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">00:01:13</a> 不知该从何入手？不如试试deepseek</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">00:02:14</a> 我的时间规划需求：拓展人脉、个人成长、休闲娱乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">00:02:40</a> deepseek 深度思考功能，好像比最后给出的方案更有用？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">00:05:16</a> 举一反三，AI可以给出我们意想不到的答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">00:05:44</a> 用“周”规划时间，完成任务更容易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">00:07:33</a> 劳逸结合，不能忽视的运动健身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">00:08:20</a> 步入正题，deepseek为我制定的时间规划方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">00:08:48</a> 拓展人脉：精准社交网络构建</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">00:10:44</a> 个人成长：专业能力升级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="747">00:12:27</a> 休闲娱乐：创意滋养系统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">00:13:46</a> 数字排毒：规划处不碰电子设备的时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">00:14:25</a> 进阶建议，deepseek额外告诉我的东西</span></p>]]></description>
