  <item>
    <title>vol.1《哪吒2》《唐探1900》.....它们凭“什么”领跑最强春节档</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a6d987d74435e4a3cde574</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a6d987d74435e4a3cde574</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Feb 2025 04:15:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年的春节档电影大家都看了嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span>是不是都被《哪吒2》刷屏了呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次小宁er换个角度来和大家聊一聊，</span></p><span></span><p><span>春节档究竟做对了什么？ 是特效炸裂？故事上头？还是精准拿捏了“中国叙事”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期从普通观众的视角，聊聊那些让我们心甘情愿掏钱买票的「电影吸引力法则」！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期评论区互动话题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>你为哪部电影贡献了票房？ 评论区聊聊你的春节档红黑榜！</span></p><span></span><p><span>预测一下：2026春节档还能打破纪录吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>快在评论区留下你的答案吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Time Line】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">00:01:21</a> 春节档一共看了三部电影，成功押宝今年的前三名</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">00:02:10</a> 大热电影拍续集，这难道是稳稳的“财富密码”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">00:03:01</a> 成功作品第二部一定不给力？《哪吒2》第一个不同意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">00:03:49</a> 《唐探》春节档“大满亚”，怎么不算荣誉呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">00:04:57</a> 第一部电影《哪吒2》，关于我的《哪吒》情怀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">00:06:34</a> 什么样的电影在春节档更受欢迎？三大方法论总结一下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">00:12:20</a> 结合大热的“谷子经济”！这波热度让《哪吒2》蹭到了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">00:17:25</a> 《哪吒2》还能救活影视股?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">00:18:27</a> 第二部电影《唐探1900》，陈思诚的唐探宇宙野心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">00:19:22</a> 英国有福尔摩斯，日本有柯南，中国有...刘昊然？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">00:22:00</a> 绑定文旅项目，跟着唐探去旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">00:23:30</a> 唐探商业密码：全IP联动，实现利益最大化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1433">00:23:53</a> 第三部电影《封神第二部》，票房为何不尽人意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">00:25:10</a> 成也营销败也营销，好内容才是硬道理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1553">00:25:53</a> 春节档电影带给我们的启示</span></p>]]></description>
